[I] A tiny simple gtk image viewer

[T] Viewnior is a simple, fast and elegant GTK image viewer with a
[T] minimalistic interface providing more screen space for images. It
[T] supports fullscreen and slideshow, rotating, flipping, cropping,
[T] animations, EXIF and IPTC metadata, and setting images as wallpaper.

[U] https://siyanpanayotov.com/project/viewnior/

